  "description": "Lee Hwan was once the Absolute Supreme of the Martial World, the undisputed Martial Emperor who unified the martial world through overwhelming power. After reaching the end of his natural lifespan, he awakens in the body of an abandoned Fourth Prince. Even more shocking, his former home, Daeya Castle, has been completely erased from history. Determined to reclaim everything he lost, the Martial Emperor begins his reign once again in a world that has forgotten him.",
